    "created_at": "2021-06-02T10:24:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-02T10:24:42Z",
    "body": "The problem is that emoji are displayed with a width of two characters in a terminal, but the sum of the widths of the characters composing the snowflake emoji is only one. The double spaces will correct rendering because most terminals will calculate the width as one and the extra space is needed to correct the offset.\r\nAnd if you're not using emoji fonts you might prefer the [nerd font preset](https://starship.rs/presets/#nerd-font-symbols) which avoids them and uses a different symbol for nix.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
