    "created_at": "2021-06-02T12:56:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-06-02T12:56:52Z",
    "body": "I am using one of the nerd fonts (Fira). I guess the two spaces rendering you mentioned is one of the edge cases of using or not a monospace font. I've seen a similar issue using Powerlevel10k theme and they address the behaviour leaving the users the choice of using the double or single width depending on the font+terminal combination they are using.\r\nIt just sounded strange to me since this is the only one symbol string using `<2 character emoji><space><space>` instead of `<2 character emoji><space>`.\r\nAnyway, if I'm the only one with this issue I might just use the configuration to override it.",
