    "created_at": "2021-08-18T02:28:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-18T02:28:13Z",
    "body": "> It just sounded strange to me since this is the only one symbol string using `<2 character emoji><space><space>` instead of `<2 character emoji><space>`.\r\n\r\nActually, it isn't. All cloud modules (gcloud, aws and openstack) also use double-width emoji plus double space afterward, shlvl, and nix.\r\n\r\nWith that being said I believe we can close this one? ",
